WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.925
justify-content places items along the row, align-items across it

2
00:00:05.927 --> 00:00:09.102
The items sit in a row, all bunched at the left.

3
00:00:09.829 --> 00:00:13.804
justify-content decides where the items sit along the row.

4
00:00:14.854 --> 00:00:18.354
The first item goes to one end, the last to the other.

5
00:00:19.205 --> 00:00:22.755
align-items decides how they line up across the row.

6
00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:26.739
Now the items sit halfway down the bar.
